#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "A Redis object-cache activation is already pending verification."
msgstr "Tá gníomhachtú taisce réad Redis ar feitheamh fíoraithe cheana féin."

#: includes/class-yperf-product-progress.php
msgid "A YPerf optimization is enabled and proven"
msgstr "Tá barrfheabhsú YPerf cumasaithe agus cruthaithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "A clean baseline was captured before migration."
msgstr "Gabhadh bunlíne ghlan roimh an imirce."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before AI-assisted "
"configuration can be applied."
msgstr ""
"Tá glacadh glan ag am rite don leagan reatha ag teastáil sular féidir "
"cumraíocht le cúnamh AI a chur i bhfeidhm."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before the R3 object-"
"cache activation can be approved."
msgstr ""
"Tá glacadh glan ag am rite don leagan reatha ag teastáil sular féidir "
"gníomhachtú taisce réad R3 a fhaomhadh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A compact guide for the provider workflow. No Cloudflare expertise is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Treoir ghairid do shreabhadh oibre an tsoláthraí. Ní gá saineolas ar "
"Cloudflare."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"A drop-in exists but WordPress did not confirm an active external object "
"cache."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhpháirt ionaid ann, ach níor dheimhnigh WordPress taisce réad "
"sheachtrach ghníomhach."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A drop-in exists. Ownership must be known before YPerf adopts page caching."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhpháirt ionaid ann. Ní mór an t-úinéir a aithint sula nglacann YPerf "
"le taisceadh leathanaigh."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A feature depending on this extension may be limited."
msgstr "D'fhéadfadh gné a bhraitheann ar an síneadh seo a bheith teoranta."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed and automatic rollback could not be confirmed."
" Stop and review the cache artifact before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar shampla HIT le taisce te agus níorbh fhéidir a dheimhniú gur "
"cuireadh an t-athrú ar ais go huathoibríoch. Stop agus athbhreithnigh an "
"chomhpháirt taisce sula leanfaidh tú ar aghaidh."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed during stability measurement. The new "
"activation was rolled back automatically."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar shampla HIT le taisce te le linn tomhas cobhsaíochta. Cuireadh an "
"gníomhachtú nua ar ais go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed while re-proving an existing executor. The "
"pre-existing cache was not removed automatically and requires review."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar shampla HIT le taisce te agus feidhmitheoir reatha á athchruthú. "
"Níor baineadh an taisce a bhí ann roimhe seo go huathoibríoch agus "
"teastaíonn athbhreithniú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A local under-the-hood report that combines WordPress, runtime, cache, "
"application and acceptance evidence. Nothing is sent remotely."
msgstr ""
"Tuairisc áitiúil gonta a chomhcheanglaíonn fianaise ó WordPress, ón "
"timpeallacht rite, ón taisce, ón bhfeidhmchlár agus ón nglacadh. Ní sheoltar"
" aon rud go cianda."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A material performance regression repeated on the confirmation pass. YPerf "
"rolled the profile back automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tharla aischéimniú suntasach feidhmíochta arís sa dara seiceáil. Chuir YPerf"
" an phróifíl ar ais go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A memory engine may be available, but WordPress has not confirmed an adopted"
" persistent object-cache execution layer."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh inneall cuimhne a bheith ar fáil, ach níor dheimhnigh WordPress "
"sraith bhuan fheidhmiúcháin taisce réad atá glactha."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A native page-cache adoption record already exists. YPerf will not activate "
"a second page-cache executor until that authority is reviewed or released."
msgstr ""
"Tá taifead glactha taisce leathanaigh dúchasaí ann cheana. Ní "
"ghníomhachtóidh YPerf dara feidhmitheoir taisce leathanaigh go dtí go "
"ndéanfar athbhreithniú ar an údarás sin nó go scaoilfear é."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A new activation rolls back automatically if cache proof or Runtime "
"Acceptance fails."
msgstr ""
"Cuirfear gníomhachtú nua ar ais go huathoibríoch má theipeann ar chruthúnas "
"taisce nó ar ghlacadh ag am rite."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A no-change planning surface built from WordPress evidence plus the optional"
" host snapshot. Explicit execution lives in the dedicated adoption/operation"
" cards and remains gated by ownership, proof and rollback contracts."
msgstr ""
"Dromchla pleanála gan athruithe, bunaithe ar fhianaise WordPress agus ar "
"léargas roghnach ón óstach. Déantar cur i bhfeidhm sainráite sna cártaí "
"glactha agus oibríochta ar leith agus tá sé faoi réir úinéireachta, "
"cruthúnais agus rialacha um aischur."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"A previous adoption record exists, but current proof no longer matches or is"
" stale. Re-prove execution before treating the adoption as current."
msgstr ""
"Tá taifead glactha ann cheana, ach ní mheaitseálann an cruthúnas reatha leis"
" nó tá sé as dáta. Cruthaigh an cur i bhfeidhm arís sula nglacann tú leis go"
" bhfuil an glacadh fós bailí."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind manual removal. "
"The transactional handover deactivates the provider first, reconciles YPerf "
"ownership, proves execution, and automatically restores the previous "
"provider if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"D’fhéadfadh advanced-cache.php atá faoi úinéireacht an tsoláthraí cosc a "
"chur ar bhaint de láimh gan seiceáil. Díghníomhachtaíonn an t-aistriú "
"idirbheartaíochta an soláthraí ar dtús, réitíonn sé úinéireacht YPerf, "
"fíoraíonn sé an cur i bhfeidhm agus athbhunaíonn sé an soláthraí roimhe sin "
"go huathoibríoch má theipeann ar an bhfíorú."

msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind removal. YPerf "
"prepares a reversible handoff, but you control W3 Total Cache activation on "
"the normal Plugins screen. After your confirmation, YPerf reconciles "
"ownership and proves the replacement."
msgstr ""
"D’fhéadfadh advanced-cache.php atá faoi úinéireacht an tsoláthraí cosc a "
"chur ar bhaint gan seiceáil. Ullmhaíonn YPerf aistriú inchúlaithe, ach is "
"tusa a rialaíonn gníomhachtú W3 Total Cache sa ghnáthscáileán Breiseán. Tar "
"éis do dheimhnithe, réitíonn YPerf úinéireacht agus fíoraíonn sé an "
"t-ionadú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A read-only site health check. It verifies public routes, cache safety and "
"origin behavior without changing settings."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil sláinte an tsuímh inléite amháin. Fíoraíonn sí bealaí poiblí, "
"sábháilteacht an taisce agus iompar an fhreastalaí tionscnaimh gan socruithe"
" a athrú."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"A score is diagnostic evidence, not a cache engine. YPerf should explain why"
" a page is slow and which layer owns the cost."
msgstr ""
"Fianaise dhiagnóiseach is ea scór, ní inneall taisce. Ba cheart do YPerf a "
"mhíniú cén fáth a bhfuil leathanach mall agus cén tsraith atá freagrach as "
"an gcostas."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "A second pass prevents one noisy sample from triggering rollback by itself."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an dara pas cosc ar shampla torannach amháin aischur a spreagadh "
"leis féin."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A technical map of YPerf and detected acceleration layers. Use Optimize or "
"Settings for normal on/off control."
msgstr ""
"Léarscáil theicniúil de YPerf agus de na sraitheanna luasghéaraithe braite. "
"Úsáid Optamaigh nó Socruithe don ghnáthrialú ar/as."

