msgid ""
"The adopted cache zone is used by more than one Nginx server block. YPerf "
"will not prepare a zone-wide purge path that could affect another site."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann níos mó ná bloc freastalaí Nginx amháin an crios taisce glactha. "
"Ní ullmhóidh YPerf conair glanta crios iomláin a d’fhéadfadh difear a "
"dhéanamh do shuíomh eile."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The audit is ready and will keep the 50 most recent semantic invalidation "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Tá an t-iniúchadh réidh agus coinneoidh sé an 50 iarratas neamhbhailithe "
"séimeantaigh is déanaí."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The baseline was rolled back after proof detected a failure or confirmed "
"regression."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an bhunlíne ar ais tar éis don chruthúnas teip nó aischéimniú "
"deimhnithe a bhrath."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The bundled Host Inspector file is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "Tá comhad Cigire Óstaigh atá sa phacáiste ar iarraidh nó doléite."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid "The cache zone is visible, but its server-block ownership is not proven yet."
msgstr ""
"Tá an crios taisce le feiceáil, ach níl a úinéireacht ag bloc freastalaí "
"fíoraithe fós."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The campaign changes only the YPerf-owned portable Page Cache boundary."
msgstr ""
"Ní athraíonn an feachtas ach teorainn Thaisce Leathanaigh iniompartha faoi "
"úinéireacht YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The contract preserves an explicit admin worker reserve and records the "
"exact before-state. R3 can adopt an already-safe native max_children limit "
"without rewriting PHP-FPM; any future host rewrite still requires syntax "
"test, read-back, Runtime Acceptance and rollback."
msgstr ""
"Caomhnaíonn an conradh cúltaca sainráite oibrithe riarthóra agus taifeadann "
"sé an staid roimhe go beacht. Is féidir le R3 teorainn dhúchasach "
"max_children atá sábháilte cheana a ghlacadh gan PHP-FPM a athscríobh; "
"teastaíonn tástáil chomhréire, athléamh, Glacadh ag Am Rite agus aischur fós"
" do gach athscríobh óstaigh amach anseo."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current Redis eviction policy is not an allkeys LRU/LFU policy. Adoption"
" remains blocked pending explicit review."
msgstr ""
"Ní beartas LRU/LFU allkeys é beartas díshealbhaithe Redis reatha. Fanann bac"
" ar ghlacadh go dtí athbhreithniú sainráite."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The current YPerf Runtime Acceptance is missing, stale or contains a "
"functional failure. Control-plane capacity is not considered releasable "
"until the site baseline is clean."
msgstr ""
"Tá Glacadh ag Am Rite YPerf reatha ar iarraidh, as dáta nó tá teip "
"fheidhmiúil ann. Ní mheastar acmhainn an phlána rialaithe a bheith ar fáil "
"go dtí go mbeidh bunlíne an tsuímh glan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf early runtime must pass before Video Lite can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh am rite luath YPerf reatha pas a fháil sular féidir Video Lite a "
"athrú."

msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before media optimization can be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh am rite luath YPerf reatha pas a fháil sular féidir optamú meán a "
"athrú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf version has clean read-only proof."
msgstr "Tá cruthúnas glan inléite amháin ag an leagan reatha de YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
