"The current advanced-cache.php ownership or hash is ambiguous. Artifact "
"refresh is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Tá úinéireacht nó hais advanced-cache.php reatha débhríoch. Tá athnuachan an"
" déantáin bactha le haghaidh athbhreithnithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current origin probe proves BYPASS rather than HIT, so there is nothing "
"safe to adopt as an active page-cache executor yet."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn tástáil an tionscnaimh reatha BYPASS in ionad HIT, mar sin níl "
"aon rud sábháilte le glacadh mar fheidhmitheoir taisce leathanaigh "
"ghníomhaigh fós."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The deeper check only adds localhost service reachability and optional "
"capability confirmation; it is not an installation step."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuireann an tseiceáil níos doimhne ach insroichteacht seirbhísí "
"localhost agus deimhniú roghnach cumais leis; ní céim suiteála í."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The delivery engine is route-aware, skips cart/checkout/account and logged-"
"in traffic, preserves theme/jQuery execution, and is covered by Runtime "
"Acceptance plus automatic rollback."
msgstr ""
"Tá an t-inneall seachadta feasach ar bhealaí, seachnaíonn sé cart/seiceáil "
"amach/cuntas agus trácht úsáideoirí logáilte isteach, caomhnaíonn sé rith "
"téama/jQuery agus tá Glacadh ag Am Rite agus aischur uathoibríoch mar "
"chosaint air."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The exact W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php is captured locally for rollback"
" before any file change."
msgstr ""
"Gabhtar advanced-cache.php cruinn W3 Total Cache go háitiúil le haghaidh "
"aischuir roimh aon athrú comhaid."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
