msgstr ""
"Tá próifíl áitiúil YPerf fíoraithe, ach níl feidhmitheoir taisce leathanaigh"
" gníomhach fós. Rith feachtas teoranta cobhsaíochta Thaisce Leathanaigh chun"
" MISS → HIT, sábháilteacht am rite agus comhsheasmhacht HIT athfhillteach a "
"chruthú sula dtéann tú níos doimhne isteach i dtiúnadh Redis nó Tionscnaimh."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf safety gate lowered the AI profile because current "
"deterministic evidence does not authorize the requested level."
msgstr ""
"D’ísligh geata sábháilteachta áitiúil YPerf an phróifíl AI toisc nach "
"n-údaraíonn an fhianaise chinntitheach reatha an leibhéal iarrtha."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The local profile was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr "Cuireadh an phróifíl áitiúil i bhfeidhm agus ghlac Glacadh ag Am Rite léi."

#: includes/class-yperf-release-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The local runtime/control-plane gates are healthy. Official WordPress Plugin"
" Check remains an external human acceptance gate and is never fabricated "
"from inside YPerf."
msgstr ""
"Tá geataí áitiúla am rite/plána rialaithe sláintiúil. Fanann Seiceáil "
"Breiseán oifigiúil WordPress mar gheata glactha daonna seachtrach; ní "
"bhréagnaítear riamh í laistigh de YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms and"
" unexpected cache churn."
msgstr ""
"Tá an loga áitiúil, teoranta agus beartaithe chun stoirm neamhbhailithe agus"
" athruithe gan choinne sa taisce a dhiagnóisiú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not ship "
"a frozen provider list."
msgstr ""
"Tagann catalóg na samhlacha ón bplean cuntais fíoraithe; ní chuireann YPerf "
"liosta seasta soláthraithe leis."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model requested a broader profile than current deterministic evidence "
"allows. YPerf lowered it before any Apply became possible."
msgstr ""
"D’iarr an tsamhail próifíl níos leithne ná mar a cheadaíonn an fhianaise "
"chinntitheach reatha. D’ísligh YPerf í sularbh fhéidir Cuir i bhFeidhm a "
"úsáid."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The native executor is adopted, but current-version Runtime Acceptance must "
"be clean before an operation plan can advance."
msgstr ""
"Tá an feidhmitheoir dúchasach glactha, ach caithfidh Glacadh ag Am Rite an "
"leagain reatha a bheith glan sula bhféadfaidh plean oibríochta dul ar "
"aghaidh."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The native proof belongs to a different hostname, so YPerf will not adopt it"
" for this site."
msgstr ""
"Baineann an cruthúnas dúchasach le hóstainm eile, mar sin ní ghlacfaidh "
"YPerf leis don suíomh seo."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Caithfidh am rite nua faoi úinéireacht YPerf pas a fháil sula gcríochnófar "
"an t-aistriú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, slow-"
"query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr ""
"Gabhfaidh an chéad Ghlacadh ag Am Rite eile líon fiosrúchán, am bunachair "
"sonraí, líon fiosrúchán mall agus teaghlaigh fiosrúchán do thástálacha an "
"chomhéadain phoiblí a ritheann ag an tionscnamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The object-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir teimpléad chomhpháirt ionaid taisce réad a ghiniúint go "
"sábháilte."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The old provider is deactivated only inside a transaction. YPerf then "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution, runs Runtime Acceptance, and "
"restores the previous provider automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhíghníomhachtaítear an soláthraí roimhe ach laistigh d’idirbheart. "
"Réitíonn YPerf úinéireacht ansin, fíoraíonn sé cur i bhfeidhm, ritheann sé "
"Glacadh ag Am Rite agus athbhunaíonn sé an soláthraí roimhe go huathoibríoch"
" má theipeann ar an gcruthúnas."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The origin probe currently proves BYPASS, so YPerf will not claim page "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn tástáil an tionscnaimh BYPASS faoi láthair, mar sin ní mhaíonn "
"YPerf luasghéarú leathanaigh."

#: assets/admin.js
msgid "The original operation may still be running. Do not start it again."
msgstr "D’fhéadfadh an oibríocht bhunaidh a bheith ar siúl fós. Ná tosaigh arís í."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The portable MU layer provides local origin protection on standard WordPress"
" hosting. Native server and edge adapters can extend protection earlier in "
"the request path."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an tsraith MU iniompartha cosaint tionscnaimh áitiúil ar "
"ghnáthóstáil WordPress. Is féidir le cuibheoirí dúchasacha freastalaí agus "
"imeallaigh cosaint a leathnú níos luaithe sa chonair iarratais."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The post-apply request set is checking public routes and safety policies."
msgstr ""
"Tá tacar iarratas iar-chur i bhfeidhm ag seiceáil bealaí poiblí agus "
"beartais sábháilteachta."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The pre-migration W3 Total Cache responsibility settings could not be "
"restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir socruithe freagrachtaí W3 Total Cache roimh aistriú a "
"athbhunú go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The previous YPerf profile is restored and the rollback Runtime Acceptance "
