msgstr ""
"Níl an tsamhail AI roghnaithe ar fáil don spás oibre fíoraithe seo. "
"Athnuaigh catalóg an chuntais agus roghnaigh arís."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected YPerf baseline was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh bunlíne roghnaithe YPerf i bhfeidhm agus ghlac Glacadh ag Am Rite "
