#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance and "
"automatically prewarmed."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh bunlíne roghnaithe YPerf i bhfeidhm, ghlac Glacadh ag Am Rite léi "
"agus rinneadh réamhthéamh uathoibríoch uirthi."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"The selected Yablonsky AI text model is not available to this verified "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Níl an tsamhail téacs Yablonsky AI roghnaithe ar fáil don spás oibre "
"fíoraithe seo."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an phróifíl áitiúil roghnaithe a chur i bhfeidhm anois laistigh de"
" theorainn WordPress faoi úinéireacht YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Ní JSON bailí é an cúltaca socruithe roghnaithe."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"Ní athraíonn an socrú ach seachadadh ó thionscnamh WordPress. Teastaíonn "
"fíorú úire neamhspleách ó iontrálacha taisce HTML seachtraigh "
"Nginx/Cloudflare; ní ghlanann YPerf taiscí óstaigh go ciúin."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Níl aon socrú iniompartha YPerf sa chúltaca socruithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr ""
"Tá an cúltaca socruithe níos mó ná teorainn sábháilteachta 256 KB a "
"dtacaítear léi."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Tá an suíomh feidhmiúil, ach ní chruthaíonn acmhainn spártha reatha an "
"óstaigh/FPM cúltaca compordach d’obair riaracháin faoi bhrú comhéadain "
"phoiblí. Ba cheart cúltaca sainráite an phlána rialaithe a chaomhnú san "
"athbhreithniú ar Bhuiséad Tionscnaimh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Tá an suíomh mapáilte le linn PHP-FPM shonrach; is féidir moltaí Buiséid "
"Tionscnaimh a bhunú ar fhianaise anois."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Tá linn an tsuímh mapáilte, ach níl sampla beo RSS oibrithe ar fáil. Ná "
"díorthaigh Buiséad Tionscnaimh ó chumraíocht amháin."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr ""
"D’fhan diagnóisic léarscáil suímh laistigh dá buiséad ama teoranta cur i "
"bhfeidhm."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Is fianaise áitiúil taisce den bhunús céanna é an méadracht chobhsaíochta, "
"ní scór Google PageSpeed. Úsáid riteanna athfhillteacha PageSpeed ina "
"dhiaidh sin mar sheiceáil sheachtrach allamuigh tar éis do YPerf cur i "
"bhfeidhm cinntitheach taisce a chruthú."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr "Theip ar sheiceáil hais athléimh na comhpháirte ionaid taisce réad céimnithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Ní mheaitseálann hais stóráilte dhéantán Thaisce Leathanaigh an comhad beo. "
"Tá athnuachan bactha."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Tá an crios eisiach don bhloc freastalaí seo. Is féidir le YPerf réamhthéamh"
" a oibriú anois agus scríbhinní óstaigh faoi ghlas fós."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Fanann codarsnacht téama, stíliú inrochtaineachta agus scripteanna tríú "
"páirtí mar ghiuirléidí comhrá lasmuigh den teorainn scríofa seo. Féadfaidh "
"YPerf na costais sin a dhiagnóisiú níos déanaí, ach ní athscríobhann an "
"feachtas seo cód seachtrach ar mhaithe le scór tagarmhairc."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "Samhlaigh PageSpeed Insights le rochtain faoin gcochall."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "Oibrítear an cumas seo de YPerf óna shreabhadh oibre teoranta tiomnaithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"Fanann an t-aistriú críochnaithe seo le feiceáil sa stair. Ní iarrann "
"nuashonruithe YPerf amach anseo ort an soláthraí céanna a aistriú arís."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "Ní cúltaca socruithe Yablonsky Performance a dtacaítear leis é an comhad seo."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"Iompaíonn an geata seo teagmhais riaracháin eatramhacha ina bhfianaise "
"shainráite eisiúna/tiúnaithe. Ní mhéadaíonn sé cuimhne PHP, ní athraíonn sé "
"FPM agus ní athraíonn sé nuashonraitheoir WordPress go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"Rianaíonn an táscaire seo cumraíocht agus fianaise an tsuímh — ní dul chun "
"cinn forbartha YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Is cumas am rite PHP é seo, ní rud ar cheart do YPerf aithris a dhéanamh air"
" in WordPress."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"Is buntáiste lárnach YPerf é seo: caitear le hobair an chéad bhuille ar "
"leithligh ón taisce HIT athfhillteach."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"Is sraith áitiúil optamaithe ísealriosca é seo; coinnítear ar leithligh ó "
"ghlacadh taisce agus freastalaí í d’aon ghnó."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé seo ar leithligh ó Ullmhacht an tSuímh. Rianaíonn sé an féidir an "
"soláthraí oidhreachta braite a scor gan freagracht ghníomhach a chailleadh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"Seo freagra ar “cad atá ag obair i ndáiríre?”. Ní thugtar stádas glas "
"GNÍOMHACH do bhrath amháin riamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"Seo an chéad teorainn scríofa áitiúil shainráite: ní fhéadfaidh YPerf ach a "
"wp-content/object-cache.php féin agus eochracha sláinte/taisce Redis lena "
"spás ainmneacha féin a chruthú sa bhunachar sonraí loighciúil curtha in "
"áirithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn an réiteoir treoraithe leis an bhfreagracht seo den soláthraí."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"Tá an athnuachan seo inléite amháin: athsheiceálann sí an timpeallacht, "
"ritheann sí Glacadh ag Am Rite agus atógann sí an tagarmharc feidhmíochta. "
"Ní chumasaíonn sí taisce, ní athraíonn sí soláthraithe agus ní athraíonn sí "
"cumraíocht óstaigh."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Tá dóthain ábhair foilsithe ar an suíomh seo le huathoibriú sreafa oibre "
"foilsithe a dhéanamh ábhartha. D’fhéadfadh comhtháthú Yablonsky Publisher "
"amach anseo fianaise feidhmíochta YPerf a úsáid gan dromchla fógraíochta a "
"dhéanamh den phainéal taisce."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"Rianaíonn an t-amharc seo ar leibhéal an tsuímh bealaí roghnacha cur i "
"bhfeidhm Redis/óstach dúchasaigh agus fianaise scoir soláthraí. Is eolas "
"amháin é agus ní dhéanann sé ceanglas eisiúna margaidh de ghnéithe roghnacha"
" óstaigh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"Ní chruthaíonn an léargas seo ach cuid den chruach dhúchasach. Rith Cigire "
"Óstaigh atá sa leagan reatha de YPerf chun úinéireacht Nginx shonrach don "
"suíomh, aonrú/cuimhne spártha Redis agus fianaise bheacht chuimhne oibrithe "
"PHP-FPM a ghabháil."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"Fianaise amháin is ea an tíl seo. Ní mhaíonn YPerf úinéireacht ar shraith am"
" rite sheachtrach."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr ""
"Trí shampla den chomhéadan poiblí in aghaidh bealaigh chomh maith le "
"tástálacha léite localhost aonraithe Redis/Memcached. Ní athraítear aon "
"socrú taisce."

