msgid ""
"YPerf does not build a second cache. The adoption stage recognizes a fresh, "
"proven site-specific Nginx cache as the authoritative page-cache executor "
"without editing Nginx or restarting any service."
msgstr ""
"Ní thógann YPerf dara taisce. Aithníonn an chéim ghlactha taisce Nginx úr "
"atá fíoraithe agus sonrach don suíomh mar fheidhmitheoir údarásach taisce "
"leathanaigh gan Nginx a chur in eagar ná aon seirbhís a atosú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not change pm.max_children, pm.max_requests or reload PHP-FPM in "
"this release."
msgstr ""
"Ní athraíonn YPerf pm.max_children ná pm.max_requests agus ní athlódálann sé"
" PHP-FPM san eisiúint seo."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf does not yet recognize this web-server family."
msgstr "Ní aithníonn YPerf an teaghlach freastalaithe gréasáin seo fós."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf enables this only when Redis isolation and memory headroom are safe. "
"It is never forced just to increase a feature count."
msgstr ""
"Ní chumasaíonn YPerf é seo ach nuair atá aonrú Redis agus cuimhne spártha "
"sábháilte. Ní fhorchuirtear riamh é chun líon na ngnéithe a mhéadú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf first captures a fresh read-only baseline, then applies the selected "
"local profile and immediately repeats Runtime Acceptance. A preflight FAIL "
"makes no changes; a post-apply FAIL restores the previous profile "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Gabhann YPerf bunlíne úr inléite amháin ar dtús, ansin cuireann sé an "
"phróifíl áitiúil roghnaithe i bhfeidhm agus ritheann sé Glacadh ag Am Rite "
"láithreach arís. Ní dhéanann TEIP réamhsheiceála aon athrú; athbhunaíonn "
"TEIP iar-chur i bhfeidhm an phróifíl roimhe go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has a current local reservation for the isolated Redis target. No "
"Redis key, drop-in or server configuration has been created."
msgstr ""
"Tá áirithint áitiúil reatha ag YPerf don sprioc Redis aonraithe. Níor "
"cruthaíodh aon eochair Redis, comhpháirt ionaid ná cumraíocht freastalaí."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has adopted the existing PHP-FPM max_children limit as the site Origin"
" Budget. No host file was rewritten because the current native limit already"
" enforces the reviewed boundary."
msgstr ""
"Ghlac YPerf leis an teorainn max_children PHP-FPM atá ann mar Bhuiséad "
"Tionscnaimh an tsuímh. Níor athscríobhadh aon chomhad óstaigh mar go "
"bhforfheidhmíonn an teorainn dhúchasach reatha an teorainn athbhreithnithe "
"cheana."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has an exact site pool, live worker-memory evidence and current "
"Runtime Acceptance. This is enough to review a bounded Origin Budget, but "
"not enough to change FPM automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tá linn bheacht an tsuímh, fianaise bheo chuimhne oibrithe agus Glacadh ag "
"Am Rite reatha ag YPerf. Is leor sin chun Buiséad Tionscnaimh teoranta a "
"athbhreithniú, ach ní leor é chun FPM a athrú go huathoibríoch."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-contract.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has exact pool identity, live worker memory evidence and a control-"
"plane reserve model. R2 freezes the reviewed before-state and rollback "
"authority without editing PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"Tá aitheantas beacht linne, fianaise bheo chuimhne oibrithe agus samhail "
"cúltaca an phlána rialaithe ag YPerf. Reonn R2 an staid roimhe "
"athbhreithnithe agus údarás aischuir gan PHP-FPM a chur in eagar."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf is already active"
msgstr "Tá YPerf gníomhach cheana"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is applying only allowlisted performance settings, then proving them "
"by read-back."
msgstr ""
"Níl YPerf ag cur i bhfeidhm ach socruithe feidhmíochta ar an liosta "
"ceadaithe, ansin á bhfíorú le hathléamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is preserving the browser-cache responsibility when it was active at "
"the source."
msgstr ""
"Caomhnaíonn YPerf freagracht taisce an bhrabhsálaí nuair a bhí sí gníomhach "
"ag an bhfoinse."

msgid "YPerf is preserving the prepared browser-cache responsibility."
msgstr "Caomhnaíonn YPerf an fhreagracht ullmhaithe taisce brabhsálaí."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is purging the homepage URL through its cache authority and the "
"adopted Cloudflare purge bridge."
msgstr ""
"Tá YPerf ag glanadh URL an leathanaigh baile trína údarás taisce agus "
"droichead glanta Cloudflare glactha."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"Níl YPerf ag athbhunú ach socruithe a d’athraigh sé roimhe agus ní "
"fhorscríobhfaidh sé athruithe seachtracha neamhghaolmhara."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"Tá YPerf ag réamhthéamh tacar teoranta URLanna poiblí ardluacha ionas nach "
"n-íocfaidh an chéad chuairteoir costas an taisce fhuair."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"YPerf keeps this option visible so the user can install or ask the host for "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn YPerf an rogha seo le feiceáil ionas gur féidir leis an úsáideoir "
"é a shuiteáil nó é a iarraidh ar an óstach níos déanaí."

msgid ""
"YPerf made no plugin activation changes. Review the page-cache ownership "
"state before retrying."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhearna YPerf aon athrú ar ghníomhachtú breiseán. Athbhreithnigh staid "
"úinéireacht an taisce leathanaigh sula ndéanann tú iarracht eile."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf may change"
msgstr "Féadfaidh YPerf athrú"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact contracts "
"are shown above. Host configuration writes still require a separately "
"reviewed helper with backup, exact diff, syntax test, read-back, acceptance "
"and rollback."
msgstr ""
"Ní fhéadfaidh YPerf ach na hoibríochtaí áitiúla tiomnaithe a bhfuil a "
"gconarthaí beachta léirithe thuas a dhéanamh. Teastaíonn cúntóir ar "
"leithligh athbhreithnithe fós do scríbhinní cumraíochta óstaigh, le cúltaca,"
" difríocht bheacht, tástáil chomhréire, athléamh, glacadh agus aischur."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf needs current read-only Redis evidence. It can use a current Host "
"Inspector snapshot or inspect a local PhpRedis service directly without "
"writing keys or changing Redis configuration."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn fianaise Redis reatha inléite amháin ó YPerf. Is féidir leis "
"léargas Cigire Óstaigh reatha a úsáid nó seirbhís PhpRedis áitiúil a "
"iniúchadh go díreach gan eochracha a scríobh ná cumraíocht Redis a athrú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf never changes"
msgstr "Ní athraíonn YPerf riamh"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf object-cache drop-in was removed. Redis was not flushed or "
"reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh comhpháirt ionaid taisce réad YPerf. Níor glanadh ná níor "
"athchumraíodh Redis."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Ní rialaíonn YPerf ach Rocket Loader MÚCHTA, HTTP/3 AR SIÚL agus sioncrónú "
"glanta."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance is "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"Tá na sraitheanna aistrithe faoi úinéireacht YPerf agus tá Glacadh ag Am "
"Rite iar-aistrithe glan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated responsibilities and post-handover Runtime "
"Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"Tá na freagrachtaí aistrithe faoi úinéireacht YPerf agus tá Glacadh ag Am "
"Rite iar-aistrithe glan."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the portable WordPress page-cache executor, cacheability policy, "
"selective purge, prewarm, execution proof and rollback. Native server cache "
"remains a separate adoption path."
msgstr ""
"Tá feidhmitheoir iniompartha taisce leathanaigh WordPress, beartas "
"inchachtáilteachta, glanadh roghnach, réamhthéamh, cruthúnas cur i bhfeidhm "
"agus aischur faoi úinéireacht YPerf. Fanann taisce dúchasach freastalaí mar "
"chonair ghlactha ar leithligh."

msgid ""
"YPerf owns the prepared replacement layers. Another plugin’s activation "
"status was never changed by YPerf."
msgstr ""
"Tá na sraitheanna ionaid ullmhaithe faoi úinéireacht YPerf. Níor athraigh "
"YPerf stádas gníomhachtaithe breiseáin eile riamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf persistent object cache is active. Redis round-trip and Runtime "
"Acceptance passed."
msgstr ""
"Tá taisce réad bhuan YPerf gníomhach. D’éirigh le timthriall Redis agus "
"Glacadh ag Am Rite."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf policy"
msgstr "Beartas YPerf"

msgid ""
"YPerf prepared the handoff but will not deactivate W3 Total Cache. Open "
"Plugins, deactivate W3 Total Cache yourself, return here, then continue. "
"This keeps plugin activation status under your control."
msgstr ""
"D’ullmhaigh YPerf an t-aistriú ach ní dhíghníomhachtóidh sé W3 Total Cache. "
"Oscail Breiseáin, díghníomhachtaigh W3 Total Cache tú féin, fill anseo agus "
"lean ar aghaidh. Coinníonn sé seo stádas gníomhachtaithe breiseán faoi do "
"rialú."

msgid ""
"YPerf prepares a reversible handoff, then asks you to deactivate W3 Total "
"Cache yourself on the WordPress Plugins screen. After you return, YPerf "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution and runs Health Check. YPerf never "
"changes another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"Ullmhaíonn YPerf aistriú inchúlaithe agus ansin iarrann sé ort W3 Total "
"Cache a dhíghníomhachtú tú féin ar scáileán Breiseáin WordPress. Tar éis "
"duit filleadh, réitíonn YPerf úinéireacht, fíoraíonn sé cur i bhfeidhm agus "
"ritheann sé Seiceáil Sláinte. Ní athraíonn YPerf stádas gníomhachtaithe "
"breiseáin eile riamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf preserves an OFF source intent and activates Page Cache only when that"
" responsibility actually needs a replacement."
msgstr ""
"Caomhnaíonn YPerf rún foinse MÚCHTA agus ní ghníomhachtaíonn sé Taisce "
"Leathanaigh ach nuair a theastaíonn ionadaí ón bhfreagracht sin i ndáiríre."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reads the provider configuration through its public runtime API. It "
"does not change W3TC settings."
msgstr ""
"Léann YPerf cumraíocht an tsoláthraí trína API am rite poiblí. Ní athraíonn "
"sé socruithe W3TC."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf reads the zone settings and effective delivery state."
msgstr "Léann YPerf socruithe an chreasa agus staid éifeachtach an tseachadta."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf recognizes the proven Nginx FastCGI cache as the authoritative page-"
"cache executor. No server configuration was changed."
msgstr ""
"Aithníonn YPerf taisce Nginx FastCGI fíoraithe mar fheidhmitheoir údarásach "
"taisce leathanaigh. Níor athraíodh aon chumraíocht freastalaí."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf refused to remove advanced-cache.php because its W3 Total Cache "
"ownership changed before write time."
msgstr ""
"Dhiúltaigh YPerf do advanced-cache.php a bhaint toisc gur athraigh a "
"úinéireacht W3 Total Cache roimh am scríofa."

msgid ""
"YPerf replacement is ready; final plugin activation status remains a user "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"Tá ionadú YPerf réidh; fanann stádas deiridh gníomhachtaithe breiseán mar "
"chinneadh an úsáideora."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "YPerf response policy active"
msgstr "Beartas freagartha YPerf gníomhach"

msgid "YPerf restored its own changes and left plugin activation status untouched."
msgstr ""
"D’athbhunaigh YPerf a chuid athruithe féin agus d’fhág sé stádas "
"gníomhachtaithe breiseán gan athrú."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. If you want W3 Total Cache active "
"again, reactivate it yourself from the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr ""
"D’athbhunaigh YPerf a chuid athruithe aistrithe féin. Más mian leat W3 Total"
" Cache a bheith gníomhach arís, athghníomhachtaigh é tú féin ón scáileán "
"Breiseáin WordPress."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive "
"until the administrator chooses to reactivate it from Plugins."
msgstr ""
"D’athbhunaigh YPerf a chuid athruithe aistrithe féin. Fanann W3 Total Cache "
"neamhghníomhach go dtí go roghnaíonn an riarthóir é a athghníomhachtú ó "
"Bhreiseáin."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own partial changes. Plugin activation status remains "
"under user control."
msgstr ""
"D’athbhunaigh YPerf a chuid athruithe páirteacha féin. Fanann stádas "
"gníomhachtaithe breiseán faoi rialú an úsáideora."

#: includes/class-yperf-cloudflare-edge.php
msgid "YPerf restored the Cloudflare settings it had adopted."
msgstr "D’athbhunaigh YPerf na socruithe Cloudflare ar ghlac sé leo."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous ownership state and stopped before accepting the"
" handover."
msgstr ""
"D’athbhunaigh YPerf an staid úinéireachta roimhe agus stop sé roimh ghlacadh"
" leis an aistriú."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous state, restored the retired W3TC responsibility "
"switches and reactivated W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""
"D’athbhunaigh YPerf an staid roimhe, d’athbhunaigh sé lasca freagrachta W3TC"
" a scoireadh agus d’athghníomhachtaigh sé W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the pre-"
"handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr ""
"Chuir YPerf gach athrú a rinne an rith aistrithe seo ar ais, lena n-áirítear"
" lasca freagrachta W3TC roimh an aistriú."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted the partial handover and restored the pre-handover provider "
"responsibility switches before returning control."
msgstr ""
"Chuir YPerf an t-aistriú páirteach ar ais agus d’athbhunaigh sé lasca "
"freagrachta an tsoláthraí roimh an aistriú sular thug sé rialú ar ais."

msgid "YPerf rollback complete."
msgstr "Aischur YPerf críochnaithe."

msgid ""
"YPerf rollback is complete. W3 Total Cache was not reactivated "
"automatically; WordPress.org requires that activation decision to remain "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"Tá aischur YPerf críochnaithe. Níor athghníomhachtaíodh W3 Total Cache go "
"huathoibríoch; éilíonn WordPress.org go bhfanann an cinneadh gníomhachtaithe"
" sin leatsa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf settings were imported and verified successfully."
msgstr "Iompórtáladh agus fíoraíodh socruithe YPerf go rathúil."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf stopped after attempting the protected rollback, but one rollback "
"component could not be verified. The UI will not claim a complete rollback."
msgstr ""
"Stop YPerf tar éis iarracht a dhéanamh ar aischur cosanta, ach níorbh "
"fhéidir comhpháirt aischuir amháin a fhíorú. Ní mhaífidh an comhéadan go "
"bhfuil aischur iomlán déanta."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf treats Redis/Valkey as bounded working memory with isolation, "
"maxmemory, hit/miss and eviction visibility."
msgstr ""
"Caitheann YPerf le Redis/Valkey mar chuimhne oibre theoranta le "
"hinfheictheacht ar aonrú, maxmemory, HIT/MISS agus díshealbhú."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf uses a site-specific namespace and generation-based cache invalidation"
" so rollback never requires deleting unrelated Redis data."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann YPerf spás ainmneacha sonrach don suíomh agus neamhbhailiú taisce "
"bunaithe ar ghlúnta ionas nach n-éilíonn aischur sonraí Redis "
"neamhghaolmhara a scriosadh riamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not activate its portable Page Cache while an adopted native "
"executor owns page-cache authority. Review or release that adoption first if"
" you intentionally want to change executors."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghníomhachtóidh YPerf a Thaisce Leathanaigh iniompartha fad atá údarás "
"taisce leathanaigh faoi úinéireacht feidhmitheora dhúchasaigh ghlactha. "
"Athbhreithnigh nó scaoil an glacadh sin ar dtús más mian leat feidhmitheoir "
"a athrú d’aon ghnó."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf will not change an advanced-cache.php whose ownership is not proven."
msgstr "Ní athróidh YPerf advanced-cache.php nach bhfuil úinéireacht fíoraithe air."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not enable database query caching just to increase a feature "
"count. It must prove a measurable benefit beside object cache and real "
"database indexes."
msgstr ""
"Ní chumasaíonn YPerf taisceadh fiosrúchán bunachair sonraí ar mhaithe le "
"líon gnéithe a mhéadú amháin. Caithfidh sé tairbhe intomhaiste a chruthú "
"taobh le taisce réad agus innéacsanna fíora bunachair sonraí."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not send a credential until the HTTPS endpoint, authentication "
"mode, workspace header and Writer transport all pass the local contract "
"gate."
msgstr ""
"Ní sheolfaidh YPerf dintiúr go dtí go n-éireoidh leis an gcríochphointe "
"HTTPS, mód fíordheimhnithe, ceanntásc spáis oibre agus iompar Scríbhneora an"
" geata conartha áitiúil a shárú."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf will preserve cart, checkout, account and session bypass rules."
msgstr ""
"Caomhnóidh YPerf rialacha seachaint taisce do chairt, seiceáil amach, cuntas"
" agus seisiúin."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will save the exact local diff and the post-apply Runtime Acceptance "
"result."
msgstr ""
"Sábhálfaidh YPerf an difríocht áitiúil bheacht agus toradh Glactha ag Am "
"Rite iar-chur i bhfeidhm."

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "YPerf-owned replacement responsibilities were activated and proved."
msgstr "Gníomhachtaíodh agus fíoraíodh freagrachtaí ionaid faoi úinéireacht YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YSEO"
msgstr "YSEO"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI API Key"
msgstr "Eochair API Yablonsky AI"

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI account verification failed. Check the API key and try again."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar fhíorú chuntas Yablonsky AI. Seiceáil an eochair API agus bain "
"triail eile as."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI account verification is not available under the reviewed "
"service contract."
msgstr ""
"Níl fíorú cuntais Yablonsky AI ar fáil faoin gconradh seirbhíse "
"athbhreithnithe."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI can analyze privacy-minimized YPerf evidence and recommend one "
"allowed local profile. AI never owns execution: deterministic safety gates "
"and your explicit Apply remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le Yablonsky AI anailís a dhéanamh ar fhianaise YPerf a ndearnadh "
"íoslaghdú príobháideachais uirthi agus próifíl áitiúil cheadaithe amháin a "
"mholadh. Ní rialaíonn AI cur i bhfeidhm riamh: fanann geataí sábháilteachta "
"cinntitheacha agus do Cuir i bhFeidhm sainráite mar údarás."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI connection settings saved."
msgstr "Sábháladh socruithe naisc Yablonsky AI."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI connection verified."
msgstr "Fíoraíodh nasc Yablonsky AI."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI connection verified. The current workspace is ready for "
"explicit AI requests."
msgstr ""
"Fíoraíodh nasc Yablonsky AI. Tá an spás oibre reatha réidh le haghaidh "
"iarratas AI sainráite."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI could not open a model-specific analysis session."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir le Yablonsky AI seisiún anailíse do shamhail ar leith a "
"oscailt."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI credit balances"
msgstr "Iarmhéideanna creidmheasa Yablonsky AI"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI only"
msgstr "Yablonsky AI amháin"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI or local Autopilot"
msgstr "Yablonsky AI nó Uathphíolóta áitiúil"

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI request was blocked because the instruction was empty."
msgstr "Cuireadh bac ar iarratas Yablonsky AI toisc go raibh an treoir folamh."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned a response that could not be validated."
msgstr "Thug Yablonsky AI freagra ar ais nárbh fhéidir a bhailíochtú."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI returned an account response that did not match the reviewed "
"User API shape."
msgstr ""
"Thug Yablonsky AI freagra cuntais ar ais nár mheaitseáil cruth "
"athbhreithnithe API Úsáideora."

